{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/extras/GIF_Sizeok.gif?t=1740601669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Halfway between a board game and a video game, Vanova's Stories is an investigative adventure for 2 to 4 players. Do you like wacky, colorful worlds, cooperating with your friends, and narrative point-and-clicks? Then this game is for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/extras/EN_Angel.png?t=1740601669\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Discover fully hand-drawn settings and explore 7 of the 13 vibrant areas of the Undersee Hotel to uncover clues about the crime committed. Whether in 2D or 3D, your observational skills will be your greatest assets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/extras/EN_Denis.png?t=1740601669\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This investigation site is inhabited by a cast of quirky and caricatured characters. In this demo, you\u2019ll have the chance to meet and question 3 of the 6 suspects. Some may refuse to talk to you... Perhaps your teammates will have better luck? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/extras/EN_Marc.png?t=1740601669\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Agility, intimidation, strength, charm\u2014everyone has their own unique ability that will lead them to clues only they can uncover. Your adventure and dialogue options will vary depending on your detective, so choose wisely!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/extras/EN_Stephanie.png?t=1740601669\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A suspect is refusing to talk to you, and you want to show him evidence to get him to confess? Swap clues with a teammate and get them to do it for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/extras/EN_Claire.png?t=1740601669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Think you've discovered the truth? Get together with your friends and tell your boss what you've found, linking all the pieces together. Make sure everyone agrees, as a wrong hypothesis could cost you dearly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is a demo version of the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some pieces, characters, or clues are not yet unlocked. Discuss together to develop a theory, but keep in mind that there are still some unknowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There may be some bugs present. If you find any, feel free to share them with us on our Discord server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Important</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're having trouble inviting one of your friends: Send a second invitation. Slow connections may cause some issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/extras/EN_End.png?t=1740601669\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3444730?t=1740601669","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3444730?t=1740601669","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/85c0ecbb08066de61f1f9ccf43c851043850bb8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740601669","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/85c0ecbb08066de61f1f9ccf43c851043850bb8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740601669","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cartoon violence"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/extras/GIF_Sizeok.gif?t=1740601669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Halfway between a board game and a video game, Vanova's Stories is an investigative adventure for 2 to 4 players. Do you like wacky, colorful worlds, cooperating with your friends, and narrative point-and-clicks? Then this game is for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/extras/EN_Angel.png?t=1740601669\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Discover fully hand-drawn settings and explore 7 of the 13 vibrant areas of the Undersee Hotel to uncover clues about the crime committed. Whether in 2D or 3D, your observational skills will be your greatest assets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/extras/EN_Denis.png?t=1740601669\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This investigation site is inhabited by a cast of quirky and caricatured characters. In this demo, you\u2019ll have the chance to meet and question 3 of the 6 suspects. Some may refuse to talk to you... Perhaps your teammates will have better luck? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/extras/EN_Marc.png?t=1740601669\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Agility, intimidation, strength, charm\u2014everyone has their own unique ability that will lead them to clues only they can uncover. Your adventure and dialogue options will vary depending on your detective, so choose wisely!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/extras/EN_Stephanie.png?t=1740601669\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A suspect is refusing to talk to you, and you want to show him evidence to get him to confess? Swap clues with a teammate and get them to do it for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/extras/EN_Claire.png?t=1740601669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Think you've discovered the truth? Get together with your friends and tell your boss what you've found, linking all the pieces together. Make sure everyone agrees, as a wrong hypothesis could cost you dearly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is a demo version of the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some pieces, characters, or clues are not yet unlocked. Discuss together to develop a theory, but keep in mind that there are still some unknowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There may be some bugs present. If you find any, feel free to share them with us on our Discord server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Important</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're having trouble inviting one of your friends: Send a second invitation. Slow connections may cause some issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/extras/EN_End.png?t=1740601669\" /></p>","developers":["Madgik Yarn Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2369640","name":"Vanova's Stories"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444730/header.jpg?t=1740601669","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257107236,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107236/movie480.mp4?t=1740600391","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107236/movie_max.mp4?t=1740600391"},"name":"English trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257107236/ded13cd967f8800de650a79157cfc324f795f0fd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740600391","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107236/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740600391","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107236/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740600391"}}],"name":"Vanova's Stories Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","r